WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.702
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.703
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.205
And now we're gonna
get to the news.

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:09.241
President Biden is reportedly
preparing to forgive $10,000

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.211
in student-loan debt
for Americans

00:00:11.211 --> 00:00:13.612
who make less than $150,000.

00:00:13.612 --> 00:00:17.784
$10,000 or, as your college
calls it, a chemistry book.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.285
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:22.121
President Biden traveled today
to Los Angeles.

00:00:22.121 --> 00:00:24.056
Not sure what for, but it's got

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:26.326
to have something to do
with "Top Gun."

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.628
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.330
The public congressional
hearings on the Capitol attack

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.999
kick off tomorrow night
in prime time.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.134
And make sure to tune in
afterwards for

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:37.737
"Talking Insurrection,"
hosted by Chris Hardwick.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.105
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.407
Fox News announced this week
that it will not carry

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:43.909
live coverage of Congress's
prime-time hearings

00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:47.013
over the Capitol attack
to focus on more important news,

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.782
like "would it kill Mulan
to wear a dress?"

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:54.186
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:57.757
British Prime Minister
Boris Johnson on Monday narrowly

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.526
survived a no-confidence vote
in Parliament.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.095
And from the looks of him,

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:05.198
he also narrowly survived
electrocution.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:06.566
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.469
[ English accent ] "I think
the hair looks quite good.

00:01:09.469 --> 00:01:12.304
I think I'll go out now

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.674
and let everyone know
that I have confidence.

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.677
I have confidence
that the hair is good."

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.645
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:22.381
[ Normal voice ] According to
a new poll, 72% of New Yorkers

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:26.352
believe Mayor Eric Adams is
doing better than or as well as

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.887
his predecessor, Bill de Blasio.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.923
I knew, if we just gave him
a chance, he would prove just

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.226
how much we didn't like
Bill de Blasio.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.928
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:38.731
The CDC this week raised its
monkeypox alert to level two.

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.900
Though if you want people
to take it seriously,

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:43.836
don't change the alert level.
Change the name.

00:01:43.836 --> 00:01:47.907
"Monkeypox" just sounds
too cute.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:51.344
"Monkeypox!
Oh, you guys, should we get it?"

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:53.446
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.381
"I'm gonna get it
for the summer."

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.650
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:01.287
A man in California was arrested
this week for allegedly stealing

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.889
an Olympic gold medal
from a car.

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:04.924
Officials suspected the man
was guilty

00:02:04.924 --> 00:02:07.660
when they very easily caught up
to him.

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:13.132
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.132 --> 00:02:16.135
Singer Jimmy Buffett's
new Margaritaville at Sea

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.637
cruise line recently launched
its first ship

00:02:18.637 --> 00:02:20.973
for a one-night-only
inaugural voyage.

00:02:20.973 --> 00:02:24.743
And nothing says "safety"
like "Margaritaville,"

00:02:24.743 --> 00:02:27.780
a song that is about a drunk guy
who cuts himself

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.515
and decides to get drunker.

00:02:29.515 --> 00:02:34.520
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:37.990
There are some people on this
show who are of the age

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:42.295
that we know the plotlines of
the Jimmy Buffett songs.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.764
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:47.399
And finally, at a recent press
conference, a judge in India

00:02:47.399 --> 00:02:50.736
referenced a case where a man
filed for divorce from his wife

00:02:50.736 --> 00:02:53.138
because she cooked him
instant noodles for every meal.

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:56.108
Well, fortunately for that guy,
he's already got a solid idea

00:02:56.108 --> 00:02:58.011
of what single life
is gonna be like.

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.111
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:01.214
And that was the monologue,
everybody!

